Storing procs in xv6

In a globally defined array present in ptable

NPROC is the maximum number of processes that can be present
in the system (#define NPROC 64)

Also present in ptable is a lock that seralizes access to the array.

struct {
struct spinlock lock;
struct proc proc[NPROC];
} ptable;

